  - id: day_of_clouds_and_thick_darkness
    displayName: Day of Clouds and Thick Darkness
    flavorText: The LORD declares a sweeping day of judgment near at hand, a day
      of the trumpet and alarm that will consume idolatry, violence, and complacent
      indifference throughout Jerusalem.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Warns Judah and Jerusalem, and by extension the whole earth, that a
      sweeping day of divine judgment is imminent, consuming idolatry, religious
      compromise, complacent indifference, and violence within the city; calls hearers
      to hold their peace before it arrives and to seek the LORD in meekness and
      righteousness in hope of being hidden from it.
    deliveredByManagerId: zephaniah
    managerId: day_of_the_lord
