  - id: sword_against_the_nations
    displayName: Sword Against the Nations
    flavorText: Zephaniah pronounces judgment on Philistia, Moab and Ammon, Cush,
      and Assyria, declaring that proud Nineveh will be made a desolation dry like
      a wilderness.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: A cycle of judgment oracles against Judah's surrounding nations, Philistia,
      Moab and Ammon, Cush, and Assyria, showing that the coming Day of the LORD
      falls on the pride and violence of every nation, framed by a call for the meek
      of the earth to seek the LORD, righteousness, and meekness before it arrives.
    deliveredByManagerId: zephaniah
